Description: Git-defined agent teams through an isolated credential proxy
 Cyclo runs Git-defined agent teams against explicitly mounted projects. It
 builds the team and credential-gateway images locally, while DComp owns their
 Docker lifecycle and durable component topology.
 .
 This package installs only the host command and its immutable resources. It
 neither starts containers nor creates system users during installation. Cyclo
 state and credentials remain per-user; Docker access is required at runtime.
